{"version":1,"key":"card:725","content":{"id":725,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"投资时我们常面临一个问题：收益高的产品风险也大，那怎么判断一项投资的「性价比」？夏普比率就是用来回答这个问题的，它衡量的是每多承担一份风险，能换来多少额外收益。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它的计算方式如下："}]},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{Sharpe Ratio} = \\frac{R_p - R_f}{\\delta_p}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"R_f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示无风险利率，比如国债的收益率"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"R_p","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示预期的投资收益率"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\delta_p","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示收益的标准差，用以衡量风险，标准差越大，波动越剧烈，风险越高"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个数字越大越好，越大说明性价比越高。如果小于 1，说明你承担的风险大于你收获的收益；如果大于 1，说明表现不错；如果大于 2，那就非常优秀了。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"看一个例子，假设目前国债收益率为 2%，有两个基金："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基金 A：年收益率为 10%，波动率为 4%"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基金 B：年收益率为 14%，波动率为 12%"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它们夏普比率分别为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{Sharpe}_A = \\frac{10\\% - 2\\%}{4\\%} = 2 \\\\\n\\text{Sharpe}_B = \\frac{14\\% - 2\\%}{12\\%} = 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 B 的收益率更高，但 A 的夏普比率远高于 B，说明 A 的性价比更好。B 的高收益是靠承担巨大风险换来的，而 A 能让你在承担更小风险的情况下依旧获得不错的收益。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当然夏普比率也有其局限性："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"过去不代表未来，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"R_p","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\delta_p","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都是根据历史数据计算得到的"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上涨也被认为是波动，会被惩罚，但上涨带来的波动其实是好事"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设收益是正态分布，但实际上存在很多黑天鹅事件，夏普比率很难衡量这种隐藏的极端风险"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["金融/夏普比率","概念"],"createTime":1779065249037,"updateTime":1779065863391,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1779065863391}}